    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1168",
      "reading_order": 1503,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 297.92,
        "r": 549.7700400000001,
        "b": 262.3299999999999
      },
      "content": "work at an ESD-protected workstation or mat. If an ESD workstation or mat is not available, touch the sheet-metal chassis to provide a static ground before touching an ESD-sensitive assembly. Protect the ESD-sensitive assemblies by placing them in ESD pouches when they are out of the printer.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1500",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1. Remove the keyboard."
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1500",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 123,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1169",
      "reading_order": 1504,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00004,
        "t": 252.92000000000007,
        "r": 548.6300400000002,
        "b": 217.32999999999993
      },
      "content": "If the replacement part is a roller or pad, avoid touching the spongy part of it. Skin oils on the roller or pad can cause paper pickup and/or print-quality problems. HP recommends using disposable gloves when handling rollers or pads or washing your hands before touching rollers or pads.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1500",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1. Remove the keyboard."
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1500",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 123,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1170",
      "reading_order": 1505,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 207.91999999999996,
        "r": 541.73,
        "b": 184.32999999999993
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: Make sure that all of the shipping materials (for example shipping tape) are removed from the replacement part prior to installation.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1500",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1. Remove the keyboard."
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1500",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 123,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1171",
      "reading_order": 1506,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.0,
        "t": 173.41999999999996,
        "r": 343.02,
        "b": 161.83000000000004
      },
      "content": "To install an assembly, reverse the removal steps.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1500",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1. Remove the keyboard."
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1500",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 123,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1172",
      "reading_order": 1507,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00002,
        "t": 152.41999999999996,
        "r": 551.6100400000003,
        "b": 116.83000000000004
      },
      "content": "When applicable, special installation instructions are provided for an assembly at the end of the removal procedure. Always completely read the removal instructions and follow all special installation instructions.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1500",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1. Remove the keyboard."
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1500",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 123,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
